@startuml
autonumber
actor User
participant Frontend
participant Server
participant JarSystem
participant SwitchEvent
participant "Old Master" as Old
participant "New Master" as New

User -> Frontend: click SetMaster(newIdx)
Frontend -> Server: WS setMaster {index}
Server -> JarSystem: SetMaster(newIdx)

JarSystem -> JarSystem: 校验: old != new 且 old 有资源(罐子或液体)?
alt 无资源 或 old == new
  JarSystem -> JarSystem: CurrentMaster = newIdx (无切换事件)
else 有资源
  JarSystem -> SwitchEvent: new WorkshopSwitchEvent(old, new).Execute()
  activate SwitchEvent

  SwitchEvent -> SwitchEvent: 快照 old/new (CreateSnapshot)
  SwitchEvent -> SwitchEvent: BansAreSame(old, new)

  alt Case 1: 禁令相同
    loop 基础形状空罐存在
      alt 有游离液体
        SwitchEvent -> Old: PourIn(emptyBaseJar, freeLiquid)
      else 无游离液体
        SwitchEvent -> Old: PourOut(任意非基础形状满罐, 未禁液体)
        SwitchEvent -> Old: PourIn(emptyJar, 倒出的液体)
      end
    end
  else Case 2: 禁令不同
    SwitchEvent -> Old: 临时附加新主台基础标记
    loop 目标形状
      SwitchEvent -> Old: ReshapeEmpty(空罐, target, cost)
      SwitchEvent -> Old: ReshapeFull(满罐, target)
    end
    SwitchEvent -> Old: 恢复附加标记 (finally)
    note right: 不再无条件清空游离液体\n可用液体在转移阶段按禁令/容量转移
  end

  loop 每个罐子
    SwitchEvent -> Old: RemoveJar(jar)
    alt New 有容量
      SwitchEvent -> New: AddJar(jar)
    else 容量满
      SwitchEvent -> SwitchEvent: log discard jar
    end
  end

  loop 每种液体
    alt New 未禁且有容量
      SwitchEvent -> New: AddLiquid(l, amt)
    else
      SwitchEvent -> SwitchEvent: log discard liquid
    end
  end

  alt 执行成功
    SwitchEvent --> JarSystem: (true, null)
    deactivate SwitchEvent
    JarSystem -> JarSystem: EventHistory.Add + CurrentMaster = newIdx
    alt newIdx == 旧从台
      JarSystem -> JarSystem: CurrentSlave = null (自动解除)
    end
  else 执行失败 (异常，内部已快照回滚)
    SwitchEvent --> JarSystem: (false, error)
    deactivate SwitchEvent
    JarSystem -> JarSystem: CurrentMaster 不变 + 返回错误
  end
end

Server --> Frontend: workshopSwitched / error + state
Frontend -> Frontend: animateWorkshopSwitch()
Frontend -> User: visual update + log
@enduml
